# Locked sidebar and header

The sidebar and header are shared chrome. A new overview version changes the scrolling page only.

## Do not change

- Markup inside `aside.side` and `header.topbar`
- CSS for `.side`, `.logo`, `.nav`, `.navsec`, `.signout-btn`, `.topbar`, `.search`, `.vers`, `.notif`, `.who`
- Sidebar width (268px), nav items, logo, sign out, search, notifications, or the signed-in user
- Primary blue `#2563eb` on the chrome (active version pill and focus ring)

## New version

Copy the latest overview file. Keep its sidebar and header. Replace only what is inside `main.scroller`.

Meters and emphasis stay in the `#2563eb` family. Amber and sage are status colors on cards only.

The only allowed header edit is appending the new version inside `nav.vers`.

```html
<a href="v5.html">V5</a>
```

```css
/* ❌ BAD — recolors the header for a new layout */
.topbar { background: #fff; }

/* ✅ GOOD — page canvas only */
.board { background: #0b1220; }
```
